// authored inline SVGs with real path data pulled from that node's exported
// assets (fi-br-box/-bookmark/-calculator/-angle-small-right), same
// convention as every other icon in this app — `fill="currentColor"` +
// baked `fillOpacity` (0.8 for the row icons, 0.5 for the chevron, matching
// the exported assets exactly) rather than a raw `<img src>` of the remote
// asset, which would also expire in ~7 days.

